WEBVTT

00:04.757 --> 00:06.097
<b>King Takuto!</b>

00:06.567 --> 00:10.207
<b>Why did you allow those two so much freedom?!</b>

00:11.277 --> 00:12.867
<b>You were watching them, weren't you?!</b>

00:14.077 --> 00:15.367
<b>Yes.</b>

00:15.367 --> 00:16.857
<b>You stopped doing your work</b>

00:16.857 --> 00:19.387
<b>just to them with your 
shared perception, didn't you?!</b>

00:19.387 --> 00:20.457
<b>Yes.</b>

00:20.457 --> 00:24.467
<b>You even had plenty of time to warn 
them with your telepathy, didn't you?!</b>

00:24.467 --> 00:26.167
<b>Well, um...</b>

00:26.167 --> 00:29.447
<b>I didn't want to be too hard 
on them and make them hate me.</b>

00:29.447 --> 00:31.787
<b>They're both at an impressionable age.</b>

00:31.787 --> 00:33.177
<b>Are you their father?!</b>

00:33.177 --> 00:36.557
<b>Are you the kind of father who 
leaves all the annoying lecturing</b>

00:36.557 --> 00:38.957
<b>to their mother so you can 
look good to your children?!</b>

00:39.917 --> 00:41.147
<b>And you two!</b>

00:41.147 --> 00:45.907
<b>What were you even thinking, conspiring 
with King Takuto to cover it up?!</b>

00:46.717 --> 00:48.407
<b>It's too late to hide it!</b>

00:48.407 --> 00:49.517
<b>Now, you three!</b>

00:49.517 --> 00:50.237
<b>Yes?!</b>

00:50.567 --> 00:55.117
<b>I hear you actually skinned a 
person before their mayor's eyes.</b>

00:55.117 --> 00:57.827
<b>We grew one step closer to being human!</b>

00:57.827 --> 00:59.177
<b>So human!</b>

00:59.177 --> 01:02.007
<b>We obtained a very human skin!</b>

01:02.007 --> 01:03.547
<b>Be quiet!</b>

01:08.217 --> 01:12.477
<b>I guess the Brain Eaters were 
a bad influence on them.</b>

01:12.477 --> 01:13.947
<b>These two!</b>

01:13.947 --> 01:15.607
<b>They eagerly gave these bird brains</b>

01:15.607 --> 01:18.277
<b>the orders to do it!</b>

01:18.277 --> 01:20.157
<b>My kids are becoming delinquents...</b>

01:20.157 --> 01:23.927
<b>I sent them off with extra warnings to 
adhere to at least the minimum manners.</b>

01:23.927 --> 01:25.897
<b>And this is the result!</b>

01:25.897 --> 01:30.947
<b>None of you are to move from this spot until 
you finish your reflection statements!</b>

01:30.947 --> 01:32.347
<b>Okay.</b>

03:06.417 --> 03:07.957
It's Well Past Your Bedtime

03:11.567 --> 03:13.317
<b>Now then!</b>

03:13.317 --> 03:16.807
<b>Let's begin the meeting about 
what to do about Dragontan!</b>

03:16.807 --> 03:18.647
<b>I'll give you some candy.</b>

03:18.647 --> 03:20.867
<b>Thank you, my king!</b>

03:20.867 --> 03:21.847
<b>Yay!</b>

03:21.847 --> 03:23.257
<b>You three!</b>

03:23.257 --> 03:24.807
<b>Do you regret what you did at all?!</b>

03:24.807 --> 03:27.947
<b>L-Lady Atou, that's enough.</b>

03:27.947 --> 03:29.567
<b>I understand how you feel,</b>

03:29.567 --> 03:32.147
<b>but I think moving the meeting 
along is more important.</b>

03:32.147 --> 03:37.527
<b>My goodness, this is all  because we 
didn't teach those twins well enough.</b>

03:37.807 --> 03:40.427
<b>Well... Fine.</b>

03:40.427 --> 03:44.247
<b>It's true that I'm not 
being as calm as usual.</b>

03:44.247 --> 03:46.997
<b>The Dragontan issue does come first.</b>

03:47.307 --> 03:48.707
<b>In that case,</b>

03:48.707 --> 03:50.417
<b>Elfuur sisters,</b>

03:50.417 --> 03:54.257
<b>may we assume your investigation was 
exactly as described in this report?</b>

03:54.257 --> 03:55.717
<b>Yes.</b>

03:55.717 --> 03:57.727
<b>We had our king look over it too,</b>

03:57.727 --> 03:59.467
<b>so that should be accurate.</b>

03:59.727 --> 04:00.877
<b>Hmm.</b>

04:00.877 --> 04:03.637
<b>It would seem the city 
is rather unsettled then.</b>

04:04.007 --> 04:05.757
<b>They lack the resources to maintain order,</b>

04:05.757 --> 04:08.257
<b>and it seems crime is on the rise.</b>

04:08.257 --> 04:11.857
<b>They would likely have face some 
manner of disturbance sooner or later.</b>

04:11.857 --> 04:15.527
<b>On top of that, they're also facing 
external attacks from Barbarians.</b>

04:15.527 --> 04:17.627
<b>When it rains, it pours.</b>

04:17.627 --> 04:19.897
<b>According to this report,</b>

04:19.897 --> 04:24.327
<b>they're facing Goblins, Orcs, 
and occasionally Hill Giants.</b>

04:24.327 --> 04:27.777
<b>Goblins and Orcs aren't a problem,</b>

04:27.777 --> 04:31.297
<b>but losses are unavoidable 
against Hill Giants.</b>

04:31.297 --> 04:34.927
<b>They suddenly appear in groups near the city,</b>

04:34.927 --> 04:40.177
<b>steadily increasing by a 
handful or so every day.</b>

04:40.177 --> 04:42.597
<b>What do you mean by "suddenly appear"?</b>

04:42.597 --> 04:46.477
<b>It's probably a result of their 
impaired ability to detect enemies.</b>

04:47.027 --> 04:49.417
<b>Beastmen generally have sharp senses that</b>

04:49.417 --> 04:52.217
<b>allow them to quickly detect 
the approach of enemies,</b>

04:52.217 --> 04:54.497
<b>but they're likely exhausted.</b>

04:55.277 --> 04:56.617
<b>Either way,</b>

04:56.617 --> 04:59.957
<b>if nothing is done, then it's only a 
matter of time before Dragontan falls.</b>

04:59.957 --> 05:03.527
<b>I think we should dispatch a large 
force as soon as possible.</b>

05:03.527 --> 05:05.367
<b>I believe our Head Warrior is right on this,</b>

05:05.367 --> 05:08.957
<b>but I don't agree with 
splitting up our forces.</b>

05:09.337 --> 05:12.147
<b>If we send our immediate 
reserves to aid in defense,</b>

05:12.147 --> 05:14.917
<b>then it will strain our 
construction and farming.</b>

05:16.377 --> 05:19.027
<b>In that case, couldn't we 
send most of our Warriors?</b>

05:19.027 --> 05:21.687
<b>Oh, by the way, I'll be 
participating as well,</b>

05:21.687 --> 05:23.617
<b>so please keep that in mind.</b>

05:23.617 --> 05:24.097
<b>Huh?!</b>

05:24.527 --> 05:28.267
<b>I see. Because of your 
ability to steal skills.</b>

05:28.267 --> 05:30.807
<b>Yes, I should be able to 
steal some useful skills,</b>

05:30.807 --> 05:34.027
<b>even from weaklings like these Barbarians.</b>

05:34.027 --> 05:35.937
<b>Isn't that right, King Takuto?</b>

05:35.937 --> 05:36.967
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:36.967 --> 05:39.107
<b>It's a good opportunity
to improve your strength,</b>

05:39.107 --> 05:42.617
<b>so I was planning to have you join them 
the moment we decided to send troops.</b>

05:42.617 --> 05:45.697
<b>In that case, you'll need a retinue.</b>

05:45.697 --> 05:47.927
<b>Please leave that to me.</b>

05:47.927 --> 05:52.087
<b>I'm certain I can entrust you with the 
troublesome negotiations and coordination,</b>

05:52.087 --> 05:55.137
<b>but I think we'll still need a few more men.</b>

05:55.137 --> 05:57.267
<b>I'll bring my apprentices with me.</b>

05:57.267 --> 05:58.687
<b>They can handle mundane tasks,</b>

05:58.687 --> 06:02.967
<b>but they can also easily defeat 
Goblins in combat with their magic.</b>

06:02.967 --> 06:04.477
<b>Understood.</b>

06:04.477 --> 06:06.017
<b>I'll be counting on you, then.</b>

06:06.017 --> 06:09.767
<b>In that case, our Warriors will 
focus on national defense.</b>

06:09.767 --> 06:13.097
<b>Honestly, I'm still a 
little concerned .</b>

06:13.097 --> 06:17.607
<b>Our national defense has relied
on Atou's presence so far.</b>

06:19.197 --> 06:21.087
<b>I can't deny that.</b>

06:21.087 --> 06:23.077
<b>To deal with that...</b>

06:24.407 --> 06:27.817
<b>We'll be making the Hero, Isla, 
the cornerstone of our defense.</b>

06:27.817 --> 06:29.247
<b>Oh!</b>

06:29.247 --> 06:32.407
<b>We're nearly finished with 
production, aren't we?</b>

06:32.407 --> 06:33.877
<b>What perfect timing.</b>

06:33.877 --> 06:36.797
<b>Truly a great display 
of our king's foresight!</b>

06:36.797 --> 06:42.027
<b>You anticipated a situation like this from
the moment we began production, didn't you?!</b>

06:42.027 --> 06:44.677
<b>Our king possesses the 
power to see the future!</b>

06:44.677 --> 06:47.407
<b><i>It's true this was perfect timing,</i></b>

06:47.407 --> 06:49.847
<b><i>but it just happened to work out that way.</i></b>

06:49.847 --> 06:50.637
<b><i>Still...</i></b>

06:52.227 --> 06:55.847
<b><i>Sometimes, pretending to be 
almighty is necessary too.</i></b>

06:55.847 --> 06:57.597
<b>Our great king is impressive!</b>

06:57.597 --> 06:58.687
<b>Clap, clap, clap!</b>

06:59.057 --> 07:01.197
<b>King Takuto, what do you think?</b>

07:01.197 --> 07:03.157
<b>Please feel free to comment.</b>

07:03.777 --> 07:07.817
<b><i>I made the right call allowing the Dark 
Elves to participate in our meetings.</i></b>

07:08.547 --> 07:12.367
<b><i>This is nothing like when I had 
to think of everything alone.</i></b>

07:12.807 --> 07:15.767
<b><i>So long as I'm managing 
a real civilization,</i></b>

07:15.767 --> 07:18.007
<b><i>their contributions are vital.</i></b>

07:18.667 --> 07:20.887
<b>Hmm, it's perfect.</b>

07:20.887 --> 07:22.407
<b>It's a great strategy.</b>

07:22.407 --> 07:24.137
<b>Please keep it up.</b>

07:24.727 --> 07:27.627
<b>To receive your praise 
is our greatest delight!</b>

07:27.627 --> 07:30.517
<b>I swear to live up to your 
expectations, my king!</b>

07:30.977 --> 07:32.307
<b>Please count on me!</b>

07:32.307 --> 07:34.517
<b>Hip, hip, hooray!</b>

07:38.167 --> 07:41.737
<b><i>Saying a few words at the end 
improved their motivation.</i></b>

07:41.737 --> 07:43.187
<b><i>Unlike in the game,</i></b>

07:43.187 --> 07:46.487
<b><i>it's the role of the leader 
to draw out their potential.</i></b>

07:47.067 --> 07:50.197
<b><i>It's a difficult task, 
but incredibly rewarding.</i></b>

07:56.007 --> 07:59.587
<b>A new Hero is finally going to be born!</b>

07:59.587 --> 08:01.627
<b>Oh, how I've long awaited this day!</b>

08:01.627 --> 08:05.987
<b>We were forced to ration quite a bit 
to secure the resources for this,</b>

08:05.987 --> 08:07.507
<b>but now that will all pay off.</b>

08:07.507 --> 08:09.817
<b>We'll get to eat our fill!</b>

08:09.817 --> 08:13.637
<b>My king, what kind of person is 
the Hero you'll be summoning?</b>

08:14.217 --> 08:16.477
<b>That's a surprise to look forward to.</b>

08:18.577 --> 08:21.507
<b><i>Atou, what do you think will happen to Isla?</i></b>

08:21.987 --> 08:25.527
<b><i>She's the first Hero we're summoning 
since coming to this world.</i></b>

08:25.527 --> 08:27.697
<b><i>I can't even begin to 
predict what will happen.</i></b>

08:28.087 --> 08:30.697
<b><i>I think it'll probably be fine though.</i></b>

08:30.697 --> 08:33.967
<b><i>On the off-chance that she does 
try to revolt against you,</i></b>

08:33.967 --> 08:36.167
<b><i>I'll protect you with my life.</i></b>

08:38.537 --> 08:41.127
<b><i>I'm able to face this critical moment</i></b>

08:41.127 --> 08:43.547
<b><i>because you're with me and 
willing to go that far.</i></b>

08:43.927 --> 08:47.297
<b><i>But I wouldn't be able to 
resummon you if I lose you,</i></b>

08:47.297 --> 08:49.887
<b><i>so please don't sacrifice yourself.</i></b>

09:14.157 --> 09:18.167
<b><i>King Takuto always prepares 
for even the slightest risk,</i></b>

09:22.947 --> 09:27.747
<b><i>but frankly, I think the 
chances of that are slim.</i></b>

09:30.227 --> 09:31.827
<b><i>There won't be any issues.</i></b>

09:34.097 --> 09:36.317
<b><i>Isn't that right, Isla?</i></b>

09:45.867 --> 09:47.957
<b>Oh great and mighty king,</b>

09:47.957 --> 09:52.737
<b>you do me a great honor by granting me 
this audience with you here in this place.</b>

09:54.307 --> 10:00.537
<b>I am Isla, the one who rules all manner of 
bugs, and my body is quivering with true joy</b>

10:00.537 --> 10:04.497
Production of the Hero, Isla, Queen of Bugs, is complete.

10:00.537 --> 10:04.497
All Bug Units in this world have gained +2 Strength.

10:00.947 --> 10:03.417
<b>at the prospect of serving you once more.</b>

10:04.877 --> 10:05.927
<b>Isla...</b>

10:05.927 --> 10:07.117
<b>It's been a long time!</b>

10:07.117 --> 10:08.737
<b>Do you recognize me?</b>

10:09.967 --> 10:11.747
<b>Oh my! Oh my!</b>

10:11.747 --> 10:14.627
<b>I see. So that's what's going on!</b>

10:14.627 --> 10:17.347
<b>Of course I remember you, King Ira Takuto!</b>

10:19.887 --> 10:22.717
<b>Allow me to ask to be certain, Isla.</b>

10:22.717 --> 10:26.147
<b>Do you truly mean your promise to serve him?</b>

10:26.147 --> 10:29.927
<b>Oh my. Silly little Atou!</b>

10:30.587 --> 10:33.037
<b>You're so cute, acting all tough!</b>

10:33.037 --> 10:35.077
<b>A-Answer the question!</b>

10:35.457 --> 10:37.557
<b>Of course I do.</b>

10:37.557 --> 10:42.077
<b>The days I've spent with King Takuto 
have been etched into this body!</b>

10:42.577 --> 10:44.497
<b>So you remember me!</b>

10:44.497 --> 10:45.377
<b>Yes.</b>

10:45.377 --> 10:50.727
<b>You were the only one able to fully 
draw out my power, after all.</b>

10:50.727 --> 10:52.507
<b>I would never forget you.</b>

10:52.937 --> 10:57.267
<b>And you were always King Takuto's 
most favorite, little Atou!</b>

10:57.267 --> 11:00.097
<b>I-I get it, so enough already!</b>

11:01.037 --> 11:02.887
<b>By the way, Master,</b>

11:02.887 --> 11:07.317
<b>would you be kind enough to explain 
the current situation to me?</b>

11:07.317 --> 11:10.227
<b>Of course. We'll talk in the palace.</b>

11:11.677 --> 11:12.487
<b>I see.</b>

11:12.487 --> 11:14.237
<b>So that's what's going on.</b>

11:14.577 --> 11:17.127
<b>Frankly, there's tons 
that I don't understand,</b>

11:17.127 --> 11:20.707
<b>but thanks to Atou, I've 
managed to get this far.</b>

11:21.247 --> 11:22.367
<b>Oh, please.</b>

11:22.367 --> 11:25.447
<b>It's only because you were 
here with me, King Takuto...</b>

11:25.447 --> 11:28.877
<b>If I were here by myself, I 
would have committed suicide.</b>

11:29.577 --> 11:30.617
<b>Atou...</b>

11:30.617 --> 11:32.057
<b>King Takuto...</b>

11:32.567 --> 11:35.637
<b>Oh my. I shouldn't be watching this.</b>

11:35.957 --> 11:38.277
<b>Regardless, I understand our strategy.</b>

11:38.277 --> 11:42.387
<b>I'll protect our peaceful 
nation in these strange lands.</b>

11:42.387 --> 11:44.857
<b>That is the duty you've entrusted to me.</b>

11:45.157 --> 11:45.897
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:45.897 --> 11:48.267
<b>You're our defense Hero, after all.</b>

11:48.267 --> 11:51.007
<b>In which case, our attack 
Hero will be the one</b>

11:51.007 --> 11:54.157
<b>to destroy the Barbarians 
in the city of Dragontan.</b>

11:55.607 --> 11:58.177
<b>Sending me is the best call,</b>

11:58.177 --> 12:00.907
<b>but I'll miss you while I'm out doing it.</b>

12:00.907 --> 12:03.227
<b>I'll miss you too, Atou.</b>

12:03.227 --> 12:06.037
<b>But you're the only one 
I can ask to handle it.</b>

12:06.527 --> 12:08.337
<b>Honestly, I'm real worried.</b>

12:08.337 --> 12:11.877
<b>I don't know if I'll be able to talk 
to the Dark Elves without you.</b>

12:11.877 --> 12:15.027
<b>We've always been together 
since we came to this world,</b>

12:15.027 --> 12:16.797
<b>and now we'll be apart...</b>

12:17.137 --> 12:18.267
<b>King Takuto!</b>

12:18.267 --> 12:19.597
<b>Atou!</b>

12:20.267 --> 12:22.867
<b>I shouldn't be watching this.</b>

12:25.257 --> 12:26.557
<b>I'm heading out!</b>

12:26.977 --> 12:29.017
<b>I promise I'll come back!</b>

12:29.297 --> 12:31.357
<b>Yeah. I'll be waiting for you.</b>

12:42.807 --> 12:44.187
<b>She's gone.</b>

12:44.187 --> 12:45.097
<b>Well then,</b>

12:45.097 --> 12:48.247
<b>I suppose I should be getting to work now.</b>

12:48.707 --> 12:50.657
<b>I'm counting on you, Isla.</b>

12:50.657 --> 12:52.597
<b>I'm raring to go!</b>

12:52.597 --> 12:57.967
<b>I'll do my part so you can enjoy this 
new game, my great King Ira Takuto!</b>

12:58.567 --> 13:01.827
<b>Leave all the details to me!</b>

13:11.337 --> 13:16.197
<b>King Takuto, you really can't do 
anything on your own, can you?</b>

13:17.817 --> 13:19.657
<b>The sun has been up for a while now.</b>

13:19.657 --> 13:22.067
<b>I can't believe you still 
weren't up at this hour.</b>

13:22.067 --> 13:24.197
<b>What have you been doing up until now?</b>

13:24.897 --> 13:27.747
<b>The king always slept in until noon.</b>

13:27.747 --> 13:30.167
<b>On days he wasn't up by noon,</b>

13:30.167 --> 13:32.997
<b>either we came to wake him or Atou did.</b>

13:33.347 --> 13:35.757
<b>What a big child you're being.</b>

13:35.757 --> 13:37.527
<b>But...</b>

13:37.527 --> 13:39.677
<b>No more buts, King Takuto!</b>

13:40.247 --> 13:44.597
<b>You are the leader of the great 
Mynoghra, the King of Ruin!</b>

13:44.597 --> 13:46.547
<b>How do you think others will see you</b>

13:46.547 --> 13:49.767
<b>if you're sleeping in until noon 
and having women come wake you up?</b>

13:49.767 --> 13:53.417
<b>Make sure you get up in 
the morning from now on.</b>

13:53.417 --> 13:55.487
<b>I'll do my best.</b>

13:55.977 --> 14:01.197
<b>You're completely different from Atou. 
She always lets our king do as he pleases.</b>

14:01.197 --> 14:02.567
<b>That reminds me!</b>

14:02.567 --> 14:07.327
<b>King Takuto, could I kindly borrow 
little Caria and Maria for a bit?</b>

14:07.327 --> 14:10.007
<b>I don't mind, but why?</b>

14:10.007 --> 14:14.227
<b>I'm not very familiar with 
Mynoghra's main facilities yet,</b>

14:14.227 --> 14:16.797
<b>so I was hoping to ask 
them to show me around.</b>

14:17.207 --> 14:21.577
<b><i>So she wants to get a look in person 
instead of just reading a map</i></b>

14:21.577 --> 14:24.567
<b><i>to get a solid picture 
of our national defenses?</i></b>

14:24.567 --> 14:25.767
<b>Yeah, all right.</b>

14:26.167 --> 14:27.477
<b>Could I ask that of you two?</b>

14:27.477 --> 14:28.657
<b>You can!</b>

14:28.657 --> 14:30.367
<b>I'll graciously accept it.</b>

14:30.367 --> 14:31.997
<b>Thank you so much, you two.</b>

14:31.997 --> 14:34.217
<b>You're very good girls, aren't you?</b>

14:34.217 --> 14:38.777
<b>Master, your people will be coming 
to seek your approval soon,</b>

14:38.777 --> 14:40.567
<b>so please look sharp.</b>

14:40.567 --> 14:42.037
<b>R-Roger that.</b>

14:42.037 --> 14:43.387
<b>Pardon me!</b>

14:44.017 --> 14:46.287
<b>Well, we'll be going now.</b>

14:46.287 --> 14:47.637
<b>Going!</b>

14:47.637 --> 14:48.757
<b>Yes.</b>

14:52.147 --> 14:55.787
<b>I wanted to ask for you to look over 
the revised assignment of our labor</b>

14:55.787 --> 14:57.397
<b>and grant your approval.</b>

14:57.397 --> 15:02.217
<b><i>This might be the first time I'm talking 
to someone other than Atou alone...</i></b>

15:02.877 --> 15:06.407
<b>Umm, are there any shortcomings 
in my proposal?</b>

15:06.407 --> 15:07.537
<b>No, no, no!</b>

15:07.537 --> 15:08.277
<b>It's all right!</b>

15:08.277 --> 15:09.637
<b>I think you've done well!</b>

15:10.007 --> 15:12.557
<b>Really?! Thank you so much!</b>

15:13.557 --> 15:15.427
<b>Yeah, this is good.</b>

15:15.427 --> 15:20.457
<b>But starting next week, reduce the manpower 
assigned to gathering and redirect it.</b>

15:20.457 --> 15:20.947
<b>Oh!</b>

15:21.337 --> 15:25.397
<b>We're adjusting how much we gather now that 
we're finished summoning the Hero!</b>

15:25.397 --> 15:26.737
<b>I'll be sure to do that!</b>

15:27.087 --> 15:28.177
<b>Phew...</b>

15:28.177 --> 15:30.987
<b><i>There's nowhere to run in 
a one-on-one conversation...</i></b>

15:30.987 --> 15:32.167
<b>Pardon me!</b>

15:32.167 --> 15:36.127
<b>I've come to get your approval on 
the training plan for our Warriors!</b>

15:37.037 --> 15:40.037
<b><i>This is incredibly tiring, 
but I'll do my best.</i></b>

15:42.347 --> 15:47.627
<b>Now, would you please be so kind as to tell 
me everything you know about our facilities?</b>

15:47.627 --> 15:48.557
<b>Everything!</b>

15:48.977 --> 15:50.437
<b>That's the government office.</b>

15:50.437 --> 15:54.097
<b>It's where the people file paperwork 
and reports get written.</b>

15:54.097 --> 15:55.957
<b>Nice and orderly.</b>

15:55.957 --> 15:57.927
<b>I love that.</b>

15:59.447 --> 16:00.817
<b>Oh my, little Emle?</b>

16:00.817 --> 16:03.197
<b>You seem busy. Are you all right?</b>

16:04.347 --> 16:05.737
<b>Can you believe it?</b>

16:05.737 --> 16:08.757
<b>Gia broke our training equipment again!</b>

16:08.757 --> 16:11.077
<b>The rate he burns through it is absurd!</b>

16:11.077 --> 16:14.157
<b>I'm at my limit trying to scrape 
together the budget!</b>

16:15.327 --> 16:19.717
<b>I'm already insanely 
busy with Moltar gone too,</b>

16:19.717 --> 16:22.407
<b>and he just had to give me more damn work!</b>

16:22.407 --> 16:27.427
<b>I'll give you head pats, so no 
more filthy language, okay?</b>

16:27.427 --> 16:30.017
<b>Ahh, so comforting...</b>

16:30.017 --> 16:33.517
<b>And I'll give our Head 
Warrior a scolding later.</b>

16:33.957 --> 16:35.517
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

16:36.007 --> 16:37.797
<b>Also, when you have some time,</b>

16:37.797 --> 16:41.037
<b>could I please ask for your 
advice on our next Building?</b>

16:41.037 --> 16:43.607
<b>Yes, if you're happy with my help.</b>

16:51.197 --> 16:53.327
<b>Put your heart into it!</b>

16:57.477 --> 17:00.747
<b>Do you think you can protect our 
king with such sloppy form?!</b>

17:01.197 --> 17:04.007
<b>I'm going to retrain you all up from scratch!</b>

17:04.007 --> 17:05.737
<b>Before you go retraining them,</b>

17:05.737 --> 17:08.677
<b>you should recount your stock of equipment.</b>

17:08.677 --> 17:11.007
<b>I-I'm sorry!</b>

17:11.007 --> 17:13.637
<b>When I get heated up over 
my training, I just...</b>

17:13.927 --> 17:17.997
<b>Forgetting yourself so quickly is 
proof that you're still a child.</b>

17:17.997 --> 17:21.477
<b>If you want to protect our king, you 
need to cultivate a cool head too.</b>

17:21.477 --> 17:24.827
<b>Ah, please stop that, Lady Isla...</b>

17:24.827 --> 17:26.947
<b>You're hurting my authority 
as Head Warrior...</b>

17:27.347 --> 17:29.727
<b>Head pats look so nice.</b>

17:30.827 --> 17:32.677
<b>Oh my, what's that sound?</b>

17:32.677 --> 17:33.797
<b>Dinner!</b>

17:33.797 --> 17:35.997
<b>Let's all go together, Isla.</b>

17:42.367 --> 17:44.527
<b>They're distributing food, I see.</b>

17:44.527 --> 17:45.277
<b>Yes.</b>

17:45.277 --> 17:48.707
<b>This is less wasteful than 
having everyone make their own.</b>

17:48.707 --> 17:50.077
<b>I'll go line up!</b>

17:50.077 --> 17:51.097
<b>Lady Isla!</b>

17:51.607 --> 17:52.687
<b>If you'll be eating,</b>

17:52.687 --> 17:54.377
<b>then please use these!</b>

17:54.377 --> 17:57.307
<b>We went and borrowed the dishware 
for visiting emissaries.</b>

17:57.307 --> 18:00.307
<b>I'm very happy for your consideration,</b>

18:01.177 --> 18:04.117
<b>but I'll use the same dishware you all are.</b>

18:04.977 --> 18:06.357
<b>N-No way!</b>

18:06.357 --> 18:07.867
<b>That would be disrespectful!</b>

18:07.867 --> 18:10.197
<b>I'm a defense Hero.</b>

18:10.197 --> 18:12.657
<b>Protecting this nation means 
protecting its people.</b>

18:12.657 --> 18:14.407
<b>I can only fulfill my duty</b>

18:14.407 --> 18:18.407
<b>when I'm able to share the perspective 
and sentiments of our people.</b>

18:20.447 --> 18:22.127
<b>What is it, Big Sis?</b>

18:26.087 --> 18:29.927
<b>I wonder where those cute twins ran off to?</b>

18:29.927 --> 18:31.677
<b>Here! We're giving it to you!</b>

18:32.207 --> 18:33.607
<b>A plate?</b>

18:33.607 --> 18:34.137
<b>Oh my!</b>

18:36.397 --> 18:37.907
<b>We want you to use it.</b>

18:37.907 --> 18:40.147
<b>It's a special plate that's 
the same as everyone else's!</b>

18:40.447 --> 18:41.467
<b>My!</b>

18:41.467 --> 18:42.467
<b>My, my!</b>

18:42.467 --> 18:45.107
<b>What adorable little girls you are!</b>

18:46.927 --> 18:49.407
<b>We finally got you to give us head pats too.</b>

18:49.407 --> 18:51.697
<b>We were feeling a little 
jealous of everyone else.</b>

18:51.697 --> 18:56.977
<b>I bet eating from such a lovely 
dish will be a fantastic treat.</b>

18:56.977 --> 19:01.197
<b>I promise to treasure it my whole life.</b>

19:06.627 --> 19:11.077
<b>If we were to grow Living 
Reeds on the border here,</b>

19:11.077 --> 19:14.097
<b>we'd have flawless defenses 
against intruders.</b>

19:20.597 --> 19:22.747
<b>Oh, my, my. What's the matter?</b>

19:22.747 --> 19:24.727
<b>It's well past your bedtime.</b>

19:24.727 --> 19:27.557
<b>I woke up. I couldn't sleep.</b>

19:27.557 --> 19:30.237
<b>I see. You too, Maria?</b>

19:30.237 --> 19:32.317
<b>Caria was having a bad dream.</b>

19:32.317 --> 19:36.077
<b>You're such a kind big sister, 
caring for your little sister.</b>

19:38.777 --> 19:42.807
<b>Would you like to tell 
me why you can't sleep?</b>

19:44.267 --> 19:46.167
<b>We have these dreams.</b>

19:46.167 --> 19:48.157
<b>Dreams of fun times.</b>

19:48.157 --> 19:49.587
<b>Dreams of our mother.</b>

19:51.577 --> 19:54.087
<b>I know that we have to move on.</b>

19:54.087 --> 19:56.877
<b>But the scenes in our dreams 
are so warm and comforting.</b>

19:56.877 --> 19:59.597
<b>Then we wake up and remember that it's all gone,</b>

19:59.597 --> 20:02.517
<b>and it hurts so much.</b>

20:02.517 --> 20:05.317
<b>So whenever one of us is 
crying from our dreams,</b>

20:05.317 --> 20:07.817
<b>the other wakes to be with her.</b>

20:08.377 --> 20:10.257
<b>So that's why.</b>

20:10.747 --> 20:12.737
<b>But it's okay.</b>

20:12.737 --> 20:16.797
<b>We have those dreams much less 
frequently than we used to.</b>

20:16.797 --> 20:19.467
<b>Tonight was the first time in a long while.</b>

20:19.467 --> 20:21.717
<b>We're sorry for worrying you.</b>

20:21.717 --> 20:23.957
<b>We'll go back to sleep in a bit.</b>

20:25.257 --> 20:27.207
<b>I just had a great idea!</b>

20:27.207 --> 20:30.937
<b>Why don't I sleep with you two from now on?</b>

20:30.937 --> 20:31.377
<b>Huh?</b>

20:31.377 --> 20:32.517
<b>Uh...</b>

20:32.517 --> 20:35.007
<b>Then when you wake up,</b>

20:35.007 --> 20:37.637
<b>you'll at least have me there with you.</b>

20:37.637 --> 20:41.797
<b>I'll always be here for you two.</b>

20:41.797 --> 20:43.387
<b>I promise.</b>

20:44.927 --> 20:46.477
<b>So warm.</b>

20:46.987 --> 20:48.817
<b>Just like those times...</b>

20:49.387 --> 20:51.447
<b>So rest easy.</b>

20:51.447 --> 20:55.727
<b>Now, come sleep in your Isla's arms.</b>

21:02.327 --> 21:04.327
<b>After discussing matters with little Emle,</b>

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
<b>I'm recommending the Learning 
Institute as our next Building.</b>

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 92 0 92

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
m 0 0 l 120 0 120 2 0 2

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
<b>Learning Institute</b>

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
<b>Building</b>

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
<b>City's Technology Research +10%
 City's Upkeep Cost -10%</b>

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
<b>Description</b>

21:04.327 --> 21:08.037
The Learning Institute is a facility that 
improves a city's research efforts through
 promotion of academics. It's indispensable
 for constructing Buildings and producing 
units that require advanced education, and it
 also reduces the upkeep cost of running a city
 through the education of scholars.

21:08.327 --> 21:09.907
<b>That sounds good to me.</b>

21:09.907 --> 21:11.497
<b>It's one we can't do without anyways,</b>

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
<b>so we'll plan to build the 
Living Reeds after that.</b>

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 78 0 78

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
m 0 0 l 120 0 120 2 0 2

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
<b>Living Reeds</b>

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
<b>Building</b>

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
<b>Defense +10%
 Bonus Damage +1</b>

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
<b>Description</b>

21:11.497 --> 21:14.967
Living Reeds is a unique facility to Mynoghra
 that replaces Stone Walls. In addition to the
 standard function, it also deals an additional
 +1 Damage to enemy units attacking the city.

21:14.967 --> 21:15.987
<b>Yes.</b>

21:15.987 --> 21:18.487
<b>The Forest gives the Dark Elves an advantage,</b>

21:18.487 --> 21:21.327
<b>and Cursed Terrain gives all 
evil beings an advantage.</b>

21:20.677 --> 21:23.637
m 0 0 l 200 0 200 58 0 58

21:20.677 --> 21:23.637
m 0 0 l 120 0 120 2 0 2

21:20.677 --> 21:23.637
<b>Larva Breeder</b>

21:20.677 --> 21:23.637
<b>Skill</b>

21:20.677 --> 21:23.637
<b>The Larva birthed by Isla in large 
quantities are unable to level up
 or carry out intellectual tasks,
 but they can be used for simple
 labor.</b>

21:21.327 --> 21:24.057
<b>Plus, I'm here, so we 
should be good for a while.</b>

21:24.057 --> 21:27.197
<b>It's not like we're actively 
at war right now either.</b>

21:27.197 --> 21:29.607
<b>So there's no need to hasten 
strengthening our defenses.</b>

21:29.607 --> 21:33.337
<b>By the way, something little Caria
 said helped me make up my mind.</b>

21:33.337 --> 21:34.227
<b>What was that?</b>

21:34.227 --> 21:36.947
<b>Oh, it just made my heart flutter!</b>

21:38.017 --> 21:42.447
<b>I want to learn a lot more 
so I can be more useful to our king.</b>

21:42.737 --> 21:43.977
<b>That's what she said.</b>

21:45.877 --> 21:47.497
<b>That reminds me, Master.</b>

21:47.497 --> 21:51.257
<b>What's going on with little Atou now?</b>

21:52.727 --> 21:55.827
<b>It looks like she's 
in a pretty amusing situation.</b>

22:15.567 --> 22:18.237
<b>John Pickett 
Henry Lin 
Meagan Smith 
William Haggard 
Rei Miyasaka</b>

